  "description": [
    "Surrounded by pebbles and rocks meticulously placed, a wooden sign tilts on a splintered stake.  A solitary wyrwood tree looms above you, its twisted branches hanging uncomfortably still.  Adjacent to the circle of stones is a makeshift shrine covered with clumps of animal fur, bloodied claws and teeth, and what appears to be cracked feystones."
